        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Model-Free Control - SARSA, Q-Learning, Exploration",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Control means *finding the optimal policy*, not just evaluating one. Without a\nmodel we learn the action-value function `q` from samples and act greedily on it.\nTwo algorithms — SARSA and Q-learning — differ in one subtle line, and that line\nis the whole on-policy / off-policy distinction."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md#003",
      "path": [
        "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control, git-history:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control]",
        "canonical_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "concepts": "[sarsa, q-learning, on-policy, off-policy, exploration, epsilon-greedy, UCB, optimism]",
        "current_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "id": "maxim:reinforcement-learning:model-free-control",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "reinforcement-learning",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[q-learning, on-policy, off-policy]",
        "section": "reinforcement-learning",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Model-Free Control - SARSA, Q-Learning, Exploration",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|              MODEL-FREE CONTROL = GPI WITH SAMPLES               |\n|                                                                  |\n|   EVALUATE q from experience  <-->  IMPROVE: epsilon-greedy(q)   |\n|                                                                  |\n|   .----------------------.        .----------------------.       |\n|   |       SARSA          |        |     Q-LEARNING       |       |\n|   |   ON-POLICY          |        |     OFF-POLICY       |       |\n|   |   target uses the    |        |   target uses the    |       |\n|   |   action ACTUALLY    |        |   GREEDY action      |       |\n|   |   taken next (A')    |        |   max_a' Q(S',a')    |       |\n|   '----------------------'        '----------------------'       |\n|         learns q_pi for                learns q_* directly       |\n|         the behavior policy            regardless of behavior    |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md#004",
      "path": [
        "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
