        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Model-Free Control - SARSA, Q-Learning, Exploration",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**The fork**: when forming the bootstrap target at `S'`, SARSA plugs in the action\nthe policy *will actually take*; Q-learning plugs in the *best* action. One word\nof difference, two different fixed points."
    },
