      "text": "**GLIE** (Greedy in the Limit with Infinite Exploration) is the condition for\ntabular convergence to `q_*`: every state-action pair is tried infinitely often,\n*and* the policy becomes greedy in the limit. `epsilon_k = 1/k` satisfies both."
    },
