        "title": "Model-Free Control - SARSA, Q-Learning, Exploration",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "> Bridge — bandits and OR: UCB and Thompson sampling come from the multi-armed\n> bandit literature, the stateless special case of RL. The bandit\n> regret-minimization theory (`operations-research/`, decision theory) is the\n> rigorous home of \"explore the uncertain arm.\" RL inherits the dilemma and adds\n> state."
    },
