      "text": "## SARSA: On-Policy TD Control"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md#019",
      "path": [
        "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control, git-history:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control]",
        "canonical_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "concepts": "[sarsa, q-learning, on-policy, off-policy, exploration, epsilon-greedy, UCB, optimism]",
        "current_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "id": "maxim:reinforcement-learning:model-free-control",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "reinforcement-learning",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[q-learning, on-policy, off-policy]",
        "section": "reinforcement-learning",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Model-Free Control - SARSA, Q-Learning, Exploration",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SARSA updates `Q(S,A)` toward a target built from the *next action the policy\nactually chooses*. Its name is the tuple it uses: **S**tate, **A**ction,\n**R**eward, next **S**tate, next **A**ction."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md#020",
      "path": [
        "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control, git-history:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control]",
        "canonical_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "concepts": "[sarsa, q-learning, on-policy, off-policy, exploration, epsilon-greedy, UCB, optimism]",
        "current_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "id": "maxim:reinforcement-learning:model-free-control",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "reinforcement-learning",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[q-learning, on-policy, off-policy]",
        "section": "reinforcement-learning",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Model-Free Control - SARSA, Q-Learning, Exploration",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|  SARSA  (on-policy)                                              |\n|                                                                  |\n|  observe S, choose A ~ epsilon-greedy(Q)                         |\n|  take A, observe R, S'                                           |\n|  choose A' ~ epsilon-greedy(Q)        <- the SAME policy         |\n|     Q(S,A) <- Q(S,A) + alpha[ R + gamma Q(S',A') - Q(S,A) ]      |\n|  S,A <- S',A'                                                    |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md#021",
      "path": [
        "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control, git-history:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control]",
        "canonical_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "concepts": "[sarsa, q-learning, on-policy, off-policy, exploration, epsilon-greedy, UCB, optimism]",
        "current_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "id": "maxim:reinforcement-learning:model-free-control",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "reinforcement-learning",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[q-learning, on-policy, off-policy]",
        "section": "reinforcement-learning",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Model-Free Control - SARSA, Q-Learning, Exploration",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The target `R + gamma Q(S',A')` uses `A'`, the action the *behavior* (epsilon-\ngreedy) policy will take. So SARSA learns `q_pi` for the policy it is *actually\nfollowing*, exploration included. It evaluates the policy it executes."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md#022",
      "path": [
        "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
