      "text": "## Q-Learning: Off-Policy TD Control"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md#024",
      "path": [
        "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control, git-history:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control]",
        "canonical_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "concepts": "[sarsa, q-learning, on-policy, off-policy, exploration, epsilon-greedy, UCB, optimism]",
        "current_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "id": "maxim:reinforcement-learning:model-free-control",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "reinforcement-learning",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[q-learning, on-policy, off-policy]",
        "section": "reinforcement-learning",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Model-Free Control - SARSA, Q-Learning, Exploration",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Q-learning's target uses `max_a' Q(S', a')` — the value of the *greedy* action,\nregardless of what the behavior policy does next."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md#025",
      "path": [
        "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control, git-history:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control]",
        "canonical_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "concepts": "[sarsa, q-learning, on-policy, off-policy, exploration, epsilon-greedy, UCB, optimism]",
        "current_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "id": "maxim:reinforcement-learning:model-free-control",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "reinforcement-learning",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[q-learning, on-policy, off-policy]",
        "section": "reinforcement-learning",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Model-Free Control - SARSA, Q-Learning, Exploration",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|  Q-LEARNING  (off-policy)                                        |\n|                                                                  |\n|  observe S, choose A ~ epsilon-greedy(Q)   (behavior policy)     |\n|  take A, observe R, S'                                           |\n|   Q(S,A) <- Q(S,A) + alpha[ R + gamma max_a' Q(S',a') - Q(S,A) ] |\n|  S <- S'                                                         |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md#026",
      "path": [
        "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control, git-history:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control]",
        "canonical_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "concepts": "[sarsa, q-learning, on-policy, off-policy, exploration, epsilon-greedy, UCB, optimism]",
        "current_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "id": "maxim:reinforcement-learning:model-free-control",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "reinforcement-learning",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[q-learning, on-policy, off-policy]",
        "section": "reinforcement-learning",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Model-Free Control - SARSA, Q-Learning, Exploration",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The target `max_a' Q(S',a')` is a sampled version of the Bellman *optimality*\noperator. So Q-learning estimates `q_*` directly — the **target policy is greedy**\nwhile the **behavior policy explores**. That separation is exactly what\n\"off-policy\" means."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md#027",
      "path": [
        "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control, git-history:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control]",
        "canonical_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "concepts": "[sarsa, q-learning, on-policy, off-policy, exploration, epsilon-greedy, UCB, optimism]",
        "current_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "id": "maxim:reinforcement-learning:model-free-control",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "reinforcement-learning",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[q-learning, on-policy, off-policy]",
        "section": "reinforcement-learning",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Model-Free Control - SARSA, Q-Learning, Exploration",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  behavior policy   = how you ACT and gather data        (epsilon-greedy)\n  target policy     = the policy you are LEARNING about   (greedy, for Q-learning)"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md#028",
      "path": [
        "04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control, git-history:reinforcement-learning:04-model-free-control]",
        "canonical_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "concepts": "[sarsa, q-learning, on-policy, off-policy, exploration, epsilon-greedy, UCB, optimism]",
        "current_path": "reinforcement-learning/04-MODEL-FREE-CONTROL.md",
        "id": "maxim:reinforcement-learning:model-free-control",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "reinforcement-learning",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[q-learning, on-policy, off-policy]",
        "section": "reinforcement-learning",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Model-Free Control - SARSA, Q-Learning, Exploration",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "on-policy  : behavior == target   (SARSA)\n  off-policy : behavior != target   (Q-learning)\n```"
    },
